{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"text_EH6zGd":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"Medium brown","text_style":"body"}},"text_b7tRnT":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"100 ml","text_style":"uppercase"}},"loox_reviews_loox_rating_B6eJNt":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/loox-reviews\/blocks\/loox-rating\/5c3b337f-fd14-4df5-b1d6-80ec13e6e28e","settings":{"contentSize":16,"pattern":"","hideText":false,"alignment":"","layout":"","textColor":"","starColor":"","showAllReviews":false,"looxOpenFloatingWidget":false,"emptyRatingWidget":true}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button","swatch_shape":"circle"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_dynamic_checkout":true,"show_gift_card_recipient":true}},"custom_liquid_TDwxCg":{"type":"custom_liquid","disabled":true,"settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div id='ss-product-videos'><\/div>"}},"complementary_3AfR6L":{"type":"complementary","settings":{"block_heading":"Recomend combining with","make_collapsible_row":true,"icon":"price_tag","product_list_limit":10,"products_per_page":3,"pagination_style":"numbers","image_ratio":"portrait","enable_quick_add":false}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"collapsible_tab_A7pHJL":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Features","icon":"none","content":"<p>The product's <strong>innovative formula<\/strong> provides the following benefits: <br\/><\/p><ul><li><em>Doesn't run down the body in streaks<\/em>, even at very high humidity<\/li><li><em>Easy and quick<\/em> application on the body without stains and streaks<br\/><\/li><li>Has a very <em>high moisture resistance<\/em><br\/><\/li><li>Natural <em>chocolate shade<\/em>.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p><br\/><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_Pa4Xgb":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Bottle features","icon":"none","content":"<p>The bottle features a unique airless system with a double bottom, allowing full use of the product without any residue left on the walls.<\/p><p><strong>Key Benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Content Protection. <\/strong>The airless design minimizes air exposure, preventing oxidation that can affect product stability. It also protects against water, moisture, dust, and bacteria, keeping the product fresh and uncontaminated.<\/li><li><strong>Extended Shelf Life. <\/strong>By blocking air, moisture, and contaminants, the airless dispenser prolongs the product's shelf life. This is why JOSS tanning cream has a long expiration period.<\/li><li><strong>Convenient Use. <\/strong>No need to unscrew lids—the vacuum pump provides precise dispensing with just a few pumps. It works in any position: upright, tilted, or upside down.<\/li><li><strong>Economical. <\/strong>The vacuum pressure dispenses small amounts, enabling better control over product usage. The airless system ensures 100% of the product is used.<\/li><li><strong>Leak Prevention. <\/strong>The durable design protects against leaks and withstands moderate impacts, ensuring no spills.<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_JWBQh6":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"How to guide","icon":"none","content":"<ul><li>Before applying the product, it’s best to exfoliate and moisturize the skin the night before, to avoid dryness and ensure an even application.<\/li><li>Apply the tanning cream to clean, dry skin for the most even coverage.<\/li><li>Shake the bottle well before using the tanning cream.<\/li><li>To achieve an ideal chocolate tone on the body, applying just one layer of cream is enough.<\/li><li>We recommend applying small drops of the cream directly onto different areas of the body and immediately spreading it over as large an area as possible.<\/li><\/ul>","page":"guides-tips"}},"collapsible_tab_PykWUV":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Additional recommendations","icon":"none","content":"<p>You can apply the cream either by hand or with nitrile gloves – suitable for those who prefer a rich tanning effect, such as users of the Latin American program.<br\/>Alternatively, you can use a special tanning mitt for application.<br\/>This is ideal for those looking for a lighter tan effect, first-time users, or those following the European program.<\/p>","page":""}},"popup_UqAXpm":{"type":"popup","settings":{"text":"FAQs","page":"faqs-tanning-cream"}},"share":{"type":"share","settings":{"share_label":"Share"}}},"block_order":["title","text_EH6zGd","text_b7tRnT","loox_reviews_loox_rating_B6eJNt","price","variant_picker","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","custom_liquid_TDwxCg","complementary_3AfR6L","description","collapsible_tab_A7pHJL","collapsible_tab_Pa4Xgb","collapsible_tab_JWBQh6","collapsible_tab_PykWUV","popup_UqAXpm","share"],"settings":{"enable_sticky_info":true,"color_scheme":"scheme-e304868b-0073-412e-91a8-5d8d8f1b005a","media_size":"medium","constrain_to_viewport":true,"media_fit":"cover","gallery_layout":"columns","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","media_position":"left","image_zoom":"lightbox","hide_variants":false,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":24}},"1729799532e9c92413":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"loox_reviews_loox_dynamic_section_3enHHX":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/loox-reviews\/blocks\/loox-dynamic-section\/5c3b337f-fd14-4df5-b1d6-80ec13e6e28e","settings":{"reviews_to_display":"","default_tab":"automatic","only_photos":false,"aggregated":false,"limit":20,"hide_thumbnails":false,"maxwidth":1080,"is_sample":true}}},"block_order":["loox_reviews_loox_dynamic_section_3enHHX"],"settings":{"include_margins":true}},"related-products":{"type":"related-products","settings":{"heading":"You may also like","heading_size":"h2","products_to_show":4,"columns_desktop":4,"columns_mobile":"2","color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_ratio":"portrait","image_shape":"default","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor